+## Accumulation semantics
+
+The helper that keeps the running total consistent across rounds obeys three invariants:
+
+- When a previous total and a current round's usage are both present, their token counts are summed field by field ([validated by: sums token counts from two usage objects](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L29)).
+- When the previous total is absent and the current round reports usage, the current round's value becomes the total ([validated by: returns current when previous is undefined](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L35)).
+- When the previous total is present and the current round reports no usage, the previous total is returned unchanged ([validated by: returns previous when current is undefined](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L43)).
+- When no round in the turn has reported usage, the hook receives `undefined` rather than a zero-filled object ([validated by: returns undefined when both sides are undefined](../../src/orchestration/orchestratorHelpers.test.ts#L51)).
